Mesa
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of this repository are derived from the Mesa agent-based modeling
framework and, specifically, from its `sugarscape_g1mt` example
(`mesa/examples/advanced/sugarscape_g1mt/`). Mesa is distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is included at
`LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

The following files are derived from Mesa and have been MODIFIED:

  sugarscape_ai_tax/agents.py
      Derived from the `sugarscape_g1mt` example agents. Modified to add
      four agent types (HumanAgent, AIAugmentedAgent, AutonomousAgent,
      OwnerHumanAgent), type-specific welfare and metabolism, and the
      displacement/reinstatement conversion machinery.

  sugarscape_ai_tax/model.py
      Derived from the `sugarscape_g1mt` example model. Modified to add
      transition dynamics, seven policy regimes, taxation and redistribution,
      endogenous resource regeneration, and the cause-of-death diagnostic.

  sugarscape_ai_tax/sugar-map.txt
      Unmodified copy of the resource landscape shipped with the
      `sugarscape_g1mt` example.

